# B2B WooCommerce Starter

A starter plugin for building a B2B (business-to-business) WooCommerce extension. This boilerplate includes wholesale customer handling, role-based pricing visibility, minimum order enforcement, and admin configuration.

## Included Features

- Wholesale customer role and registration fields
- B2B company details on registration
- Minimum order threshold enforcement
- Admin settings page for B2B configuration
- Product visibility rules for wholesale users
- Frontend notices and styling ready for customization

